    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Croissant",
        "text": "This feller's got the same energy as my Baws, the Emperor..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_201_moeshd_summer",
            "name2": "avg_npc_074",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "High Priest",
        "text": "Emperor? Are you talking about that penguin?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_201_moeshd_summer",
            "name2": "avg_npc_074",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Croissant",
        "text": "Sure am. Hold on a minute, you know the Baws?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_201_moeshd_summer",
            "name2": "avg_npc_074",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "High Priest",
        "text": "Of course, of course I do. Though it's been a couple of decades since we last met... Eh, was it a few decades? Or a few centuries? Doesn't matter. I can smell him on you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_337_utage_summer_1#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Utage",
        "text": "What's that about a few centuries...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_201_moeshd_summer",
            "name2": "avg_npc_074",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Croissant",
        "text": "Lordy loo! Who'da thunk I'd meet a friend of the Baws out here!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "So you really do exist. I always thought Zumama got messed up in the head and hallucinated you. I was even researching similar cases at Rhodes Island."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_074"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "High Priest",
        "text": "Oh, don't you know, Gavial? Whenever you came to look for Zumama, I was always there watching!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "High Priest",
        "text": "Just like this!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "He disappeared!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_074",
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "High Priest",
        "text": "Hahaha, I wouldn't normally show myself to you, but since I want to pilot the Big Ugly, I have no choice!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "High Priest",
        "text": "Building machines with the little ones is actually a lot of fun!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_337_utage_summer_1#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Utage",
        "text": "Speaking of the Big Ugly, shouldn't somebody be driving it? 'cause I'm pretty sure it's about to crash into that house."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_074"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
